    # capability adds no default and absence is the pre-existing behaviour character for character.
    ("ds-kv-args-dash-dash", ds(), ""),
    # The save direction, then — in a **separate process** — the load direction over the file the
    # save wrote. The order in this list is the order `record` runs them, which is what makes
